w><msub><mtext>Float</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Float}_i = LS_i - ES_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Float</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ES</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 为最早开始时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LS</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 为最晚开始时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LF</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 为最晚完成时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为任务 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的后继任务集合。浮动时间（Float）为零的任务在关键路径上——任何延迟都会导致项目整体延迟。</p>\n<h3 id=\"甘特图与里程碑\">甘特图与里程碑</h3><p><strong>甘特图</strong>（Gantt Chart）是项目进度的可视化表示，横轴为时间、纵轴为任务，每个任务用水平条表示其起止时间。甘特图直观展示了任务的<strong>并行关系和资源冲突</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>里程碑</strong>（Milestone）是项目中具有特殊意义的时间点，通常标志着一个阶段的完成或重要交付物的产出。里程碑不是任务——它没有工期，是一个零时长的事件。良好的里程碑设计遵循 SMART 原则：具体、可度量、可达成、相关、有时限。</p>\n<h3 id=\"估算的不确定性与锥体模型\">估算的不确定性与锥体模型</h3><p><strong>估算锥</strong>（Cone of Uncertainty）由 Barry Boehm 和 Steve McConnell 研究总结，描述了项目估算精度随时间推移的演化模式。在项目初期，估算的误差范围可能是实际值的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.25</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.25x \\sim 4x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.25</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>；随着需求细化和设计推进，误差范围逐渐收窄：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>项目阶段</th>\n<th>估算误差范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>初始概念</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.25</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.25x \\sim 4x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.25</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需求完成</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5x \\sim 2x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设计完成</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.67</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.67x \\sim 1.5x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.67</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编码完成</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>1.25</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.8x \\sim 1.25x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.25</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这意味着在项目早期给出精确的&quot;最终成本&quot;承诺是不现实的。敏捷方法通过<strong>滚动式计划</strong>（只详细计划近期迭代，远期保持粗粒度）来适应这种不确定性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"挣值管理-evm\">挣值管理（EVM）</h3><p>挣值管理（Earned Value Management）是一种将范围、进度和成本整合监控的定量方法。三个基本量：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>PV</strong>（Planned Value）：计划到某时间点应完成的工作价值</li>\n<li><strong>EV</strong>（Earned Value）：到该时间点实际完成的工作价值</li>\n<li><strong>AC</strong>（Actual Cost）：到该时间点实际花费的成本</li>\n</ul>\n<p>由此派生出关键绩效指标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>进度绩效指数</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SPI = \\frac{EV}{PV} \\quad (\\text{进度绩效指数})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">进度绩效指数</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>成本绩效指数</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CPI = \\frac{EV}{AC} \\quad (\\text{成本绩效指数})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">成本绩效指数</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SPI &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示进度落后，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CPI &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示超支。项目完成时的总成本预测为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EAC = \\frac{BAC}{CPI}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BAC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 是项目总预算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>某项目有以下任务和依赖关系：A(3天)→C(4天)→E(2天)，B(5天)→D(3天)→E(2天)，A(3天)→D(3天)。求关键路径和项目最短工期。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>一个项目的 BAC 为 100 万元。到第 8 周时，PV = 40 万，EV = 35 万，AC = 42 万。计算 SPI 和 CPI，分析项目状态，并预测完成时的总成本 EAC。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>你的团队进行了 Planning Poker，对某用户故事的估算结果为：2, 3, 3, 5, 13。请描述你作为 Scrum Master 应如何主持接下来的讨论。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>COCOMO 模型假设工作量与代码规模呈幂函数关系。讨论这一假设在现代开发实践（大量使用开源库和框架，代码生成工具普及）中的局限性。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>McConnell, S. (2006). &quot;Software Estimation: Demystifying the Black Art&quot;</strong>：软件估算领域最实用的指南，数据驱动且案例丰富。</li>\n<li><strong>Brooks, F.P. (1995). &quot;The Mythical Man-Month&quot; (Anniversary Edition)</strong>：软件工程管理的经典之作，&quot;人月&quot;概念的起源。</li>\n<li><strong>Cohn, M. (2005). &quot;Agile Estimating and Planning&quot;</strong>：敏捷估算与计划的权威指南，详解故事点和 Planning Poker。</li>\n<li><strong>PMI. &quot;PMBOK Guide&quot; (7th Edition)</strong>：项目管理知识体系的标准参考，包含 WBS、CPM、EVM 等方法的规范定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>项目计划与估算是将软件开发从&quot;凭感觉&quot;提升为&quot;可管理&quot;的关键环节。WBS 提供了分解复杂性的结构化框架，COCOMO 和 Planning Poker 提供了不同粒度的估算工具，关键路径法和甘特图提供了进度编排的可视化手段，挣值管理提供了过程中的定量监控能力。面对软件项目固有的不确定性，最重要的不是追求一次性的&quot;精确计划&quot;，而是建立持续监控和调整的计划体系。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学软件工程 — 项目计划与估算","id":"大学软件工程-项目计划与估算"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"工作分解结构（WBS）","id":"工作分解结构-wbs"},{"level":3,"text":"估算方法","id":"估算方法"},{"level":3,"text":"进度编排：关键路径法","id":"进度编排-关键路径法"},{"level":3,"text":"甘特图与里程碑","id":"甘特图与里程碑"},{"level":3,"text":"估算的不确定性与锥体模型","id":"估算的不确定性与锥体模型"},{"level":3,"text":"挣值管理（EVM）","id":"挣值管理-evm"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学软件工程 — 持续集成与持续交付","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/software-engineering/software-quality/continuous-integration"},"next":{"title":"大学软件工程 — 风险管理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/software-engineering/project-management/risk-management"}}